id: pm-vcs-74qw
title: Make sparse view widening and narrowing descriptor-safe against ancestor replacement
description: "Separate from PR 96 materializeTree/restore review scope. Repository.setView retains path-based rmSync/mkdirSync/writeFileSync/chmodSync after its preflight. A disposable fixture stages branch/leaf.txt, narrows to visible/**, then swaps branch for an outside-directory symlink at widening mkdirSync: setView(null) overwrites the outside sentinel. Apply the shared pinned-directory mutation boundary to widening/narrowing with deterministic race tests and preserve sparse preflight/view/index behavior."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 0
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-07T22:47:10.756Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-07T22:48:39.811Z"
author: codex-sol
expected_result: Concurrent ancestor substitution refuses without changing outside or nested control state.
actual_result: Synthetic widening reproduction overwrote an independent outside sentinel.
