  "2026-10-07T22:48:39.811Z",codex-sol,"Confirmed with a disposable fixture: retain an untracked file in branch so narrowing does not prune the directory, narrow the tracked leaf to visible/**, then replace branch with an outside symlink exactly at widening mkdirSync. setView(null) returns successfully and the outside sentinel becomes the tracked content. No hosted or real user data involved. Follow-up remains open; PR 96 requested materializeTree/restore changes stay scoped."
